.TH ads-xml-gen "1" "2026-08-03" "LinuxCNC Documentation" "The Enhanced Machine Controller"
.SH NAME
ads-xml-gen \- generate a TwinCAT-compatible ADS XML symbol table

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ads-xml-gen
.I config.conf

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ads-xml-gen
reads an ADS
.B .conf
configuration file, as used by the LinuxCNC ADS (Beckhoff Automation
Device Specification) server support, and generates a
TwinCAT-compatible XML symbol table from the symbol tree and aliases
defined there.  The XML is written to standard output.

.SH EXIT STATUS
Returns 0 on success, 1 if the configuration file cannot be parsed or
the XML cannot be generated.

.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR gomc-server (1)

